# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# Only /adm is a client-side route, so only /adm is rewritten to the SPA shell.
# A blanket `/* /index.html 200` would return HTTP 200 for every non-existent
# URL, which search engines treat as a soft 404 and can index as duplicates of
# the home page. Everything unmatched now falls through to 404.html with a real
# 404 status.
#
# Static files (assets, logos, robots.txt, sitemap.xml) are served before these
# rules are consulted, so they are unaffected.
/adm      /index.html   200
/adm/*    /index.html   200
